{"title": "Unknown", "index": 14, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre2\">\n<div class=\"calibre3\" id=\"Section0010_0001.xhtml\">\n<p class=\"calibre7\"><span class=\"calibre19\">刽子手用一根丝绳绞死红衣主教卡拉法，</span></p>\n<p class=\"calibre7\"><span class=\"calibre19\">绳子断了：不得不重复两次。</span></p>\n<p class=\"calibre7\"><span class=\"calibre19\">红衣主教看着刽子手，一言未发。</span></p>\n<p class=\"calibre7\"><span class=\"calibre20\">——司汤达《帕利亚诺公爵夫人》</span></p></div>\n</body>"}]}